3
00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:54.519
Ah. you see.
Gennarino in Praiano didn't have <i>ovoline.</i>

4
00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:56.280
so he gave me the braids instead.

5
00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.680
Then he gave me a bit of a discount.
Look here.

6
00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:03.000
Who are you?

7
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.640
Daniel.

8
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:06.400
Daniel?

9
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.280
Your name is Daniel?

10
00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.000
Daniel De Luca.

11
00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:38.720
Thank you so much.

12
00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.160
Your grandma was right about you.

13
00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:51.280
Hi.

14
00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.600
Eat.

15
00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.400
Nice kid.

16
00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.520
- Who the fuck is he?
- No idea.

17
00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:11.040
Five euro. cash.

18
00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.599
Don't worry.

19
00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:29.680
What's your name?

20
00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.280
Hassan.

21
00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:34.399
Where are you from. Hassan?

22
00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.480
Zuwara.

23
00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:40.960
Do you speak Italian?

24
00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:10.960
See you later.

25
00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.320
What are we gonna do with Bruno?

26
00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.920
My house is your house. DD.

27
00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.880
Bruno. let's go.

28
00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:45.040
Put it down. Come on.

29
00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.799
Put it down.

30
00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.000
Now fuck off both of you. go.

31
00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.760
Who. Alice? No.

32
00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.320
His name is Bruno.

33
00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:43.200
Oh. please.

34
00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.759
In the meantime. can I offer you a coffee?

35
00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.640
Yes.

36
00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:14.160
Hello?

37
00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:41.920
Why? Do you think
there's something strange going on?

38
00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.680
- Exactly. Bye. kid.
- Bye. Bignè.

39
00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:54.440
Mum...

40
00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.559
Coffee. tuna. <i>bottarga.</i>
tomatoes. mozzarella.

41
00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:34.720
Tomatoes from where?

42
00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:51.760
The owner. who is he? What's his name?

43
00:22:03.480 --> 00:22:04.480
Thank you.

44
00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:06.080
You're welcome.

45
00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:09.640
- Who is Albertini?
- The tomatoes guy.

46
00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:41.440
You have more luck than sense.

47
00:22:57.480 --> 00:22:58.960
Alright. let's go.

48
00:23:51.760 --> 00:23:53.159
Good morning. police.

49
00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:56.160
I'm looking for Mister Daniel De Luca.

50
00:25:44.800 --> 00:25:47.120
- Chief Maurizio Spagnuolo?
- Yes.

51
00:25:49.600 --> 00:25:51.960
No. it's a different police station.

52
00:25:53.680 --> 00:25:54.680
In Caserta.

53
00:25:59.160 --> 00:26:02.680
Or perhaps lawyer Giraldi.
or Francesca...

54
00:26:20.600 --> 00:26:21.600
Mister...?

55
00:26:22.800 --> 00:26:24.240
Mister... I mean...

56
00:26:25.040 --> 00:26:27.399
Superintendent Caserti...

57
00:26:27.400 --> 00:26:28.480
Casertani.

58
00:26:28.880 --> 00:26:32.400
So. so lovely to meet you.
superintendent Casertani.

59
00:26:36.880 --> 00:26:37.920
Goodbye.

60
00:28:52.720 --> 00:28:54.480
Listen. put these around your wrists.

61
00:28:54.920 --> 00:28:55.920
No. Bignè...

62
00:28:56.520 --> 00:28:58.240
Put them on. Quick.

63
00:29:26.960 --> 00:29:28.000
His mother.

64
00:29:33.040 --> 00:29:34.160
His mother?

65
00:29:39.160 --> 00:29:41.120
I'm looking for Amina Younis.

66
00:29:41.840 --> 00:29:43.520
This kid's mum.

67
00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:46.240
This is Hassan.

68
00:29:47.000 --> 00:29:48.600
I need to find Amina.

69
00:29:52.640 --> 00:29:53.600
Come.

70
00:29:58.160 --> 00:30:01.040
Amina is locked in a nearby building.

71
00:30:06.160 --> 00:30:07.159
Thank you.

72
00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:09.160
Don't make me lose my job.

73
00:30:16.240 --> 00:30:17.240
Hi.

74
00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:56.320
One second.

75
00:30:57.600 --> 00:31:00.440
Why that evil face? Easy. I come in peace.

76
00:31:06.160 --> 00:31:07.520
Nothing happened.

77
00:31:10.160 --> 00:31:11.920
Go back to work. Africa.

78
00:31:17.960 --> 00:31:19.680
Who are you? What do you want?

79
00:31:55.440 --> 00:31:58.960
What the fuck are you doing? Let go of me!

80
00:33:35.200 --> 00:33:36.120
My love.

81
00:35:30.840 --> 00:35:32.159
Where is Alice?

82
00:35:32.160 --> 00:35:33.759
Where did you hide my sister?

83
00:35:33.760 --> 00:35:35.919
- Piece of shit! Where's Alice?
- My hair!

84
00:35:35.920 --> 00:35:37.599
- Alright. alright!
- My hair!

85
00:35:37.600 --> 00:35:38.680
Where's Alice?

86
00:35:40.240 --> 00:35:41.400
- My hair!
- Enough!

87
00:36:06.640 --> 00:36:07.919
Let's go. Go.

88
00:36:07.920 --> 00:36:09.200
Asshole!

89
00:36:55.200 --> 00:36:56.200
Hello?

90
00:36:57.640 --> 00:36:58.640
Hello?

91
00:37:01.200 --> 00:37:03.519
<i>- I'm coming back. dad.</i>
- Alice?

92
00:37:03.520 --> 00:37:04.959
I love you.

93
00:37:04.960 --> 00:37:06.280
<i>I love you too.</i>

94
00:37:06.880 --> 00:37:08.000
<i>I'm waiting for you.</i>

95
00:38:54.760 --> 00:38:55.920
Good morning. princess!

